5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura. This is going to be so much fun! Who wants to start?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hi, I'm Minato. I'm a little nervous, but I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Hey, I’m Takumi. Let’s not waste time. Who’s the first one you all think is acting suspicious?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hi! I’m Mio. I’m excited to play! Let’s all share our thoughts and figure this out together.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,I observe. Silence is data. Let’s see who blinks first.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
